@startuml 设备生命周期主状态机
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title 设备生命周期主状态机 | Device Lifecycle State Machine\n(云端中台 CLOUD-P0-03)

[*] --> InspectionPending : 到店会话创建(OTP验证通过)

state InspectionPending : 待质检\nInspectionPending
state Inspecting : 质检中\nInspecting
state InspectionRejected : 已完成-拒收\nRejected(终止)
state InspectionDone : 质检完成\nInspectionDone
state PendingReview : 待上架申请\nPendingReview
state Available : 在库可售\nAvailable
state Paying : 付款中\nPaying
state Sold : 已售\nSold
state Shipped : 已发货\nShipped(终止)
state Returning : 退货中\nReturning
state Refunded : 已退货退款\nRefunded(终止)

InspectionPending --> Inspecting : 店员开始质检(外观+硬件)
InspectionPending --> InspectionRejected : 外观拒收\n(损坏照片≥3张+选择拒收原因)

Inspecting --> InspectionDone : 数据上传成功+定价引擎出价
Inspecting --> Inspecting : 单步中断→从断点恢复\n(断电/USB断开/App崩溃)
Inspecting --> InspectionRejected : 准入检查命中\n(IMEI黑名单/iCloud锁/进水/无法开机)

InspectionDone --> PendingReview : 用户接受报价+店老板核销成功\n+DB发旧机到仓库+入库确认
InspectionDone --> InspectionRejected : 用户拒绝报价(归还设备)

PendingReview --> Available : 运营审核通过\n(机况一致→直接上架+计算商城售价+上传商品主图)
PendingReview --> Available : 运营调整后上架\n(机况不符→下调成色/补扣款→重算价格→上架)

Available --> Paying : 用户下单(提交订单→5分钟独占锁)

Paying --> Sold : Razorpay支付成功回调
Paying --> Available : 支付超时(5分钟) / 用户主动取消

Sold --> Shipped : 仓库出库(扫码核销IMEI+打印面单)

Shipped --> Returning : 用户发起退货(7天内)

Returning --> Refunded : 退货审核通过+仓库收货确认+退款完成
Returning --> Shipped : 退货审核拒绝

@enduml


@startuml 换购会话生命周期
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title 换购会话生命周期 | Trade-in Session Lifecycle\n(门店平板+服务端)

[*] --> SessionCreated : 店员输入手机号\n+OTP验证通过

state SessionCreated : 会话已创建\nCreated
state Authorizing : 授权中（到店）\nAuthorizing
state Inspecting : 质检进行中\nInspecting
state InspectionPaused : 质检中断\nPaused
state PriceGenerated : 报告已生成\n报价待用户决策
state UserRejected : 用户拒收\nUserRejected(终止)
state VerificationInProgress : 核销进行中\n店老板录入价格+用户新机确认
state Completed : 换购完成\nCompleted(终止)

SessionCreated --> Inspecting : 店员开始质检
SessionCreated --> Authorizing : 到店用户需H5授权\n(P2阶段不再使用,已由OTP替代)

Authorizing --> Inspecting : 用户扫码同意
Authorizing --> UserRejected : 用户拒绝授权

Inspecting --> InspectionPaused : 断电/USB断开/崩溃
InspectionPaused --> Inspecting : 恢复→从断点继续
Inspecting --> PriceGenerated : 所有检测项完成+数据上传+定价引擎出价
Inspecting --> UserRejected : 外观拒收

PriceGenerated --> VerificationInProgress : 用户在App/H5点击接受报价
PriceGenerated --> UserRejected : 用户拒绝报价 / 报价30分钟超时

VerificationInProgress --> Completed : 店老板录入售价→系统校验→\n用户新机登录确认→店老板点击确认核销

@enduml


@startuml B2C购买订单状态机
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title B2C 购买订单状态机 | B2C Order State Machine\n(C端App+服务端)

[*] --> PendingConfirm : 用户点击提交订单

state PendingConfirm : 待确认\nPendingConfirm
state Paying : 付款中\nPaying
state Paid : 已支付\nPaid
state Shipped : 已发货\nShipped
state Delivered : 已签收\nDelivered
state Returning : 退货中\nReturning
state Returned : 已退货退款\nReturned(终止)
state Cancelled : 已取消\nCancelled(终止)
state Completed : 已完成(超期)\nCompleted(终止)

PendingConfirm --> Paying : 系统加锁成功(5分钟)
PendingConfirm --> Cancelled : 库存不足/设备已被他人锁定

Paying --> Paid : Razorpay支付成功
Paying --> Cancelled : 支付超时(5分钟)→释放锁
Paying --> Cancelled : 用户主动取消

Paid --> Shipped : 仓库出库(扫码核销+面单)
Paid --> Cancelled : 用户取消(待发货)\n→退款+释放库存

Shipped --> Delivered : 物流签收
Shipped --> Returning : 用户发起退货(签收前)

Delivered --> Returning : 用户发起退货(签收7天内)
Delivered --> Completed : 超过7天未退货→自动完成

Returning --> Returned : 退货审核通过+退款完成
Returning --> Delivered : 退货审核拒绝

@enduml


@startuml B2B批量采购订单状态机
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title B2B 批量采购订单状态机 | B2B Order State Machine\n(C端App企业模式+服务端)

[*] --> PendingPayment : 提交批量订单+所有设备加锁成功

state PendingPayment : 待支付\nPendingPayment
state Paying : 付款中\nPaying
state Confirmed : 已确认\nConfirmed
state Splitting : 拆单中\nSplitting
state PartiallyShipped : 部分发货\nPartiallyShipped
state FullyShipped : 全部发货\nFullyShipped
state CreditPending : 授信待结算\nCreditPending
state CreditSettled : 授信已结算\nCreditSettled(终止)
state Completed : 已完成\nCompleted(终止)
state Cancelled : 已取消\nCancelled(终止)

PendingPayment --> Paying : 选择直接企业支付→Razorpay
PendingPayment --> CreditPending : 选择授信支付\n(校验额度→扣减→确认)

Paying --> Confirmed : 支付成功
Paying --> Cancelled : 支付超时/失败→释放所有锁

CreditPending --> Confirmed : 授信额度扣减成功
CreditPending --> Cancelled : 授信额度不足→引导切换直接支付

Confirmed --> Splitting : 智能路由引擎\n按仓库聚合拆分为子订单

Splitting --> PartiallyShipped : 部分子订单仓库出库
PartiallyShipped --> FullyShipped : 全部子订单出库完成
PartiallyShipped --> PartiallyShipped : 其他仓库陆续出库

FullyShipped --> Completed : B2C直付订单完成
FullyShipped --> CreditSettled : 授信订单→DB结算→\n门店付款→确认收款→释放额度

@enduml


@startuml 核销确认状态机
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title 核销确认状态机 | Verification State Machine\n(店老板App+用户App+服务端CLOUD-P0-02)

[*] --> UserAccepted : 用户在App/H5点击接受报价

state UserAccepted : 用户已接受\nUserAccepted
state OwnerPricePending : 待店老板录入售价\nOwnerPricePending
state PriceValidated : 售价校验通过\n待用户新机确认
state UserConfirmed : 用户新机确认\n待店老板最终核销
state Verified : 已核销\nVerified(终止)
state Expired : 已过期\nExpired(终止)

UserAccepted --> OwnerPricePending : 推送抵扣金额至店老板App

OwnerPricePending --> PriceValidated : 店老板录入新机售价+实付金额\n系统校验:新机售价−抵扣=实付 ✓
OwnerPricePending --> OwnerPricePending : 金额不匹配→提示修正\n(新机售价−抵扣≠实付)
OwnerPricePending --> Expired : 30分钟超时未录入

PriceValidated --> UserConfirmed : 用户在新手机登录App\nApp自动读取新机IMEI/型号\n用户确认金额无误

UserConfirmed --> Verified : 用户在App点击"确认核销"\n→标记为已核销→旧机回收完成\n→推送通知至店老板App
UserConfirmed --> Expired : 30分钟超时未确认

@enduml


@startuml 质检检测步骤状态机
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title 质检检测步骤状态机 | Inspection Step State Machine\n(平板质检工具 TAB-P0-02/TAB-P0-11)

[*] --> PhotoCapture : 开始质检

state PhotoCapture : 外观拍照(3)\n10张+视频
state PhotoQualityCheck : 拍照质量检测\n(P1 模糊/光线/角度)
state RejectionCheck : 外观拒收判断(5)
state HardwareAudit : 硬件审计(6-7)\nUSB OTG
state InvoiceCapture : 发票采集(8)\n可选
state DataUpload : 数据上传(9)
state PricingWait : 等待定价
state ReportDisplay : 报告展示(10)

PhotoCapture --> PhotoQualityCheck : 每张照片拍摄后
PhotoQualityCheck --> PhotoCapture : 质量不合格→重拍提示
PhotoQualityCheck --> RejectionCheck : 全部10张完成

RejectionCheck --> HardwareAudit : 外观正常→继续
RejectionCheck --> Rejected : 外观无法回收\n→拒收流程→会话终止

HardwareAudit --> HardwareAudit : 单项失败→跳过+标记异常\n(超时30秒/手动跳过)
HardwareAudit --> HardwareAudit : 单项中断→从断点恢复\n(断电/USB断开→持久化检查点)

HardwareAudit --> InvoiceCapture : 硬件审计完成

InvoiceCapture --> DataUpload : 跳过发票 / 发票录入完成

DataUpload --> PricingWait : 上传成功
DataUpload --> DataUpload : 上传失败→重试\n(断点续传)

PricingWait --> ReportDisplay : 定价引擎返回报告+报价

state Rejected : 已完成-拒收

@enduml


@startuml 售后退货状态机
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title 售后退货状态机 | After-Sales Return State Machine\n(C端App+仓库+服务端)

[*] --> ReturnRequested : 用户发起退货申请

state ReturnRequested : 待审核\nReturnRequested
state ReturnApproved : 审核通过\n待退回
state ReturnRejected : 审核拒绝\nReturnRejected(终止)
state PickupScheduled : 已预约取件\nPickupScheduled
state ReturnShipped : 退货在途\nReturnShipped
state WarehouseReceived : 仓库已收货\n待鉴定
state Refunding : 退款中\nRefunding
state Refunded : 已退款\nRefunded(终止)
state ExchangeApproved : 换货审核通过\nExchangeApproved
state ExchangeShipped : 换货已发出\nExchangeShipped
state ExchangeReceived : 用户已收到换货\nExchangeReceived(终止)

ReturnRequested --> ReturnApproved : 运营审核通过
ReturnRequested --> ReturnRejected : 运营审核拒绝(附原因)

ReturnApproved --> PickupScheduled : 选择上门取件→预约时间
ReturnApproved --> ReturnShipped : 选择自行寄回→上传快递单号

PickupScheduled --> ReturnShipped : 物流取件完成

ReturnShipped --> WarehouseReceived : 仓库签收

WarehouseReceived --> Refunding : 鉴定通过(与质检记录一致)
WarehouseReceived --> ReturnRejected : 鉴定不通过(人为损坏/IMEI不符)

Refunding --> Refunded : Razorpay原路退款成功

ReturnApproved --> ExchangeApproved : 用户选择换货
ExchangeApproved --> ExchangeShipped : 仓库重新出库(换货设备)
ExchangeShipped --> ExchangeReceived : 用户签收换货

@enduml


@startuml 授信额度状态机
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title B2B 授信额度状态机 | B2B Credit Line State Machine\n(服务端CLOUD-P1-06+DB端)

[*] --> Active : 运营配置授信额度

state Active : 额度正常\nActive
state Deducted : 额度已扣减\n订单待结算
state Overdue : 逾期未结算\nOverdue
state Frozen : 额度冻结\nFrozen
state Settled : 已结算释放\nSettled

Active --> Deducted : 门店授信支付下单\n可用额度−订单金额

Deducted --> Active : DB发起结算→门店付款\n→DB确认收款→释放额度
Deducted --> Overdue : 超过结算周期未付款\n(T+7/T+15)

Overdue --> Frozen : 运营/DB手动冻结

Frozen --> Active : 门店还清逾期款\n+运营解冻额度

@enduml


@startuml 预约单状态机
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title 换购预约单状态机 | Appointment State Machine\n(C端App+服务端CLOUD-P1-01)

[*] --> Booked : 用户在App填写旧机信息\n+选择门店+预约时间

state Booked : 已预约\nBooked
state CheckedIn : 已到店\nCheckedIn
state NoShow : 爽约\nNoShow(终止)
state Cancelled : 已取消\nCancelled(终止)
state Completed : 已完成(关联换购)\nCompleted(终止)

Booked --> CheckedIn : 到店OTP验证通过\n(自动匹配预约)
Booked --> NoShow : 预约时间+24小时未到店
Booked --> Cancelled : 用户主动取消预约

CheckedIn --> Completed : 换购完成(核销成功)

@enduml
